---
import LayoutDefault from '../../layouts/layout.default.astro'
import PageHeader from '../../components/page-header.astro'
---

<LayoutDefault>
    <PageHeader slot="hero" title="Privacy Policy" />

    <div class="py-16 sm:py-20">
        <div class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-4 sm:px-6">
            <div class="prose prose-gray max-w-none">

                <h2>1. Data controller</h2>
                <p>
                    The controller responsible for the processing of personal data on this website is:
                </p>
                <p>
                    Health Care Information Technologies for Africa e.V. (HITA e.V.)<br />
                    c/o Marion Fellmann<br />
                    Josef-Schmitt-Str. 4<br />
                    D-97922 Lauda-Königshofen<br />
                    Germany<br />
                    Email: <a href="mailto:geschaeftsstelle@hita-ev.org">geschaeftsstelle@hita-ev.org</a>
                </p>

                <h2>2. General principles</h2>
                <p>
                    This is a static website. We do not use tracking cookies, analytics tools, or
                    social media plugins. We collect personal data only to the extent technically
                    necessary to operate the website and do not share it with third parties without
                    your explicit consent.
                </p>

                <h2>3. Server log files</h2>
                <p>
                    When you visit our website, the web server automatically stores information in
                    so-called server log files. This includes:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Browser type and version</li>
                    <li>Operating system in use</li>
                    <li>Referrer URL (the page previously visited)</li>
                    <li>Hostname of the accessing device</li>
                    <li>Time of the server request</li>
                    <li>IP address (anonymised)</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    This data cannot be attributed to specific individuals. It is not merged with
                    other data sources and is deleted after a short retention period.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The legal basis for this processing is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest
                    in operating the website without disruption).
                </p>

                <h2>4. Contact by email</h2>
                <p>
                    If you contact us by email, your details – including the contact information
                    you provide – will be stored for the purpose of processing your enquiry and
                    any follow-up questions. We will not share this data without your consent.
                </p>
                <p>
                    The legal basis is Art. 6(1)(f) GDPR (legitimate interest in responding to
                    enquiries) or Art. 6(1)(b) GDPR (performance of a contract) where your
                    enquiry relates to the conclusion of a contract.
                </p>

                <h2>5. Your rights</h2>
                <p>
                    You have the right to:
                </p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Obtain information about the personal data we hold about you (Art. 15 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Request correction of inaccurate data (Art. 16 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Request deletion of your data (Art. 17 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Request restriction of processing (Art. 18 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Receive your data in a common format (data portability, Art. 20 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Object to the processing of your data (Art. 21 GDPR)</li>
                    <li>Lodge a complaint with a data protection supervisory authority</li>
                </ul>
                <p>
                    To exercise your rights, please contact us at:
                    <a href="mailto:geschaeftsstelle@hita-ev.org">geschaeftsstelle@hita-ev.org</a>
                </p>

                <h2>6. Data security</h2>
                <p>
                    This website uses SSL/TLS encryption for security and to protect the
                    transmission of confidential content. You can recognise an encrypted connection
                    by the address bar of the browser changing from "http://" to "https://" and
                    by the lock icon in your browser bar.
                </p>

                <h2>7. Currency of this privacy policy</h2>
                <p>
                    We reserve the right to update this privacy policy so that it always complies
                    with current legal requirements. Last updated: October 2026.
                </p>

            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</LayoutDefault>

<style>
    .prose h2 {
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        color: #111827;
    }
    .prose h2:first-child {
        margin-top: 0;
    }
    .prose p {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        line-height: 1.75;
        color: #4b5563;
    }
    .prose ul {
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        list-style-type: disc;
        color: #4b5563;
    }
    .prose li {
        margin-bottom: 0.375rem;
        line-height: 1.625;
    }
    .prose a {
        color: #e2263d;
        text-decoration: none;
    }
    .prose a:hover {
        text-decoration: underline;
    }
</style>
